    "https://careers.bridgew.edu/channels/graduate-students/": {
      "title": "Graduate Students",
      "description": "Graduate Students – Career Services &  Internship Program | Bridgewater State University BSU and Career Services & Internships will be closed on Monday, September 7th for the Labor Day holiday. New: AI Search is live — ask any career question and get instant answers from our resources. Just click on the \"U\" message icon in the bottom right corner. Log in for personalized results. Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Access Handshake Schedule an Appointment Request a Workshop Customize Your Experience Who You Are Students Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Non-Degree Students Transfer Students Alumni Faculty & Staff Parents & Families Prospective Students & Guests Affinities/Identities Asian, Pacific Islanders, & Native American Black/African American First-Generation International Students Latine LGBTQIA+ Students With Disabilities Undocumented Students Veterans Women Career Interests Aviation Business, Accounting and Finance Communications, Marketing and Media Counseling & Human Services Education Fine & Performing Arts Health Care and Wellness Public Administration, Government, and Law STEM (Science, Technology, Engineering & Mathematics) Technology and Cybersecurity Undeclared Students/Explore Career Options Career Resources Bear Essentials Career Readiness: What Employers Are Looking For Cooperative Education (Co-op) Program Create a Resume or Cover Letter Digital Content Library Expand Your Network Explore Your Interests / Self Assessment Find an Internship Internship Funding Make the Most of a Career Fair Negotiate an Offer Prepare for an Interview Prepare for Graduate School Professional Development Funding Search for a Job Signature Internship Programs Design Your Career at BSU Recruit BSU Talent Employer Services HireLocally Job Postings/Handshake Career Fairs & Events Branding Opportunities Internship Information for Employers Internship FAQs CUBEs Industry Mentors Program Recruiting Policies Support #BSU Works About Us Mission & Memberships CSI Reports Staff Location, Parking and Social Media Schedule Appointments Vendor/Resource Requests Career Outcomes Graduate Students Labor Market Insights Featured Articles Career Resources Career Resources Jobs & Internships Labor Market Insights Alumni Connections Gain Experience Career Outcomes Featured Articles Clubs & Associations Career Videos The Career Services & Internships Office provides comprehensive career development resources and programs for all BSU students and alumni. Graduate students at BSU can take advantage of the various opportunities throughout their time at BSU to prepare themselves for the workforce. Handshake, a One-Stop Career Management System All BSU graduate students will receive a Handshake account within their first semester at BSU. Students can access job and internship opportunities, RSVP for career events, request a career advisement appointment, and connect with employers through the system. Students will continue to receive access to Handshake beyond graduation, making this a powerful system to jump start their careers. One-on-One Career Advisement Schedule a one-on-one career advisement session with a professional career advisor to design your career plan. You can request an in-person or virtual session through Handshake. Career Fairs, Industry Panels, Networking Events and Forums BSU students can access a variety of events, career fairs, panels, and career forums throughout the year that are organized by the Career Services & Internships Office such as the Fall & Spring Job and Internship Fairs, Industry Insiders series, Resume-Mania events, and other skill development workshops. Visit Handshake for the latest list of upcoming events. Skip filter options to posts Featured Articles Filter Clear Filter: Filters See More Filters Filter Controls Blog Categories: Alumni Stories Career & Professional Development Advice Employer Spotlights Front Page News Guest Blog