rld skills. Stand out to employers. Forage is a free, self-paced online platform that … Read More What Can I Do With This Major? Share This: Share What Can I Do With This Major? on Facebook Share What Can I Do With This Major? on LinkedIn Share What Can I Do With This Major? on X Copy Link Learn about career options based on your studies at BSU. The website provide you with information regarding career options and … Read More FOCUS 2 Share This: Share FOCUS 2 on Facebook Share FOCUS 2 on LinkedIn Share FOCUS 2 on X Copy Link Take the Focus 2 Assessment to learn about your values, interests, personality, skills, and interests. Career advisors can discuss and … Read More Handshake Share This: Share Handshake on Facebook Share Handshake on LinkedIn Share Handshake on X Copy Link The nation’s largest career management platform connecting students and alumni to career resources, recruiting events, internships, and jobs across the … Read More CareerSpring Share This: Share CareerSpring on Facebook Share CareerSpring on LinkedIn Share CareerSpring on X Copy Link Launching your career is a whole new journey, and you don’t have to travel it alone. We provide a one-of-a-kind … Read More View All Resources Job & Internship Opportunities Content Media Intern Castix LLC Associate Financial Planner Intern - Summer 2028 Cain Watters & Associates, LLC Editorial Intern Punchbowl News Summer Intern - Marketing & Sales Union Pacific Railroad Corporate Communications Intern Sallie Mae Entry Level Marketing and Sales Intern Morph Management, Inc. See All Jobs Featured Articles One Goal for This Semester: Build Your Career Readiness Finding the Right Major for You Transitioning from College to Corporate: Your Late-Summer Prep Checklist How to leverage your summer internship into a full-time offer What Is a Staffing Firm or a Temporary Employment Agency? View All Contact & Location Phone 508-531-1328 Email careerservices@bridgew.edu Website https://careers.bridgew.edu/ Address Rondileau Student Union (RSU), Room 104 19 Park Avenue Bridgewater, MA 02325 Office Hours M Monday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm T Tuesday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm W Wednesday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm TH Thursday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm F Friday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm Phone 508-531-1328 Email careerservices@bridgew.edu Website https://careers.bridgew.edu/ Address Rondileau Student Union (RSU), Room 104 19 Park Avenue Bridgewater, MA 02325 Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Alumni Connections Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Bridgewater State University"
