-week summer program for undergraduates and recent graduates, based … View more and apply Political Canvasser North Shore Strategies Share This: Share Political Canvasser on Facebook Share Political Canvasser on LinkedIn Share Political Canvasser on X Copy Link Recruitment began on August 31, 2026 and the job listing Expires on September 27, 2026 Full-time Political CanvasserNorth Shore Strategies – Schenectady, NY Pay: $25/hour Classification: Temporary, Non-Exempt Hours per Shift: 5, seasonal/short-term assignments Start Date / End Date: 09/08/2026 – 11/03/2026 North Shore Strategies is seeking motivated and professional Political Canvassers to support our grassroots field efforts across Schenectady, NY. The ideal candidate is an enthusiastic, outgoing communicator who is passionate about civic engagement and committed to promoting Democratic causes. Political Canvassers are on the front lines of our campaign operations, having direct conversations with … View more and apply Director Of Sales Trilogy Health Services, LLC Share This: Share Director Of Sales on Facebook Share Director Of Sales on LinkedIn Share Director Of Sales on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 1, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 2, 2026 Full-time The Director of Sales, a member of the campus Sales & Growth Team, is primarily responsible for leading the sales and marketing at the campus by developing and executing strategies designed to achieve revenue and census goals. Key Responsibilities Meet established targets for lead and lease conversions for both Health Center and Senior Living. Increase community awareness and reputation through participation in outside events, professional groups, and stakeholder organizations. Develop and implement a strategic, rolling 90-day sales plan that supports … View more and apply Account Manager Integrated Services Data Axle Share This: Share Account Manager Integrated Services on Facebook Share Account Manager Integrated Services on Linke