-time Business Development Executive – Fast-Track Your Career – Executive Search Metric are a New York founded Global Staffing Agency. Recognized by the Financial Times as one of the fastest-growing companies in 2025, with 7 global offices in the UK and US. We offer a world-leading 2-week intensive training program designed to equip you with all the skills you need to thrive in a high-performance sales environment. What you’ll do as a Business Development Executive? Develop new business & build client … View more and apply Marketing Specialist Eazzy Consulting Share This: Share Marketing Specialist on Facebook Share Marketing Specialist on LinkedIn Share Marketing Specialist on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 2, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 3, 2026 Full-time Marketing Specialist $17/HR + UNCAPPED COMMISSION & BONUSES | $85K–$150K+ POTENTIAL | FLUSHING, NY Eazzy Consulting is looking for a motivated and creative Marketing Specialist to help generate new business through online advertising, marketing campaigns, lead generation, and direct client outreach. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys marketing, social media, advertising, making calls, talking to people, and finding creative ways to generate business. Responsibilities Post advertisements across websites, social media, online platforms, and other channels Find free and … View more and apply Entry Level Outside Sales Representative HIBU Share This: Share Entry Level Outside Sales Representative on Facebook Share Entry Level Outside Sales Representative on LinkedIn Share Entry Level Outside Sales Representative on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 2, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 3, 2026 Full-time Are you a college student preparing to graduate and looking to kick-start a rewarding career in sales? Or have you recently graduated and are seeking a fresh opportunity to grow and thrive in sales? Whether you’ve studied business, marketing, communications—or just love connecting with people—Hibu is here to help you launch your career with confidence. We’re looking for motivated individuals who are ready to grow, learn, and thrive in a fast-paced, high-reward environment. Our award-winning training program and supportive team … View more and apply Revenue Intelligence Strategist Phenom Share This: Share Revenue Intelligence Strategist on Facebook Share Revenue Intelligence Strategist on LinkedIn Share Revenue Intelligence Strategist on X Copy Link Recruitment began on September 2, 2026 and the job listing Expires on October 3, 2026 Full-time Job Description Phenom is an Applied AI platform helping enterprises attract, engage, hire, develop, and retain talent. As AI transforms the future of work, we’re evolving how revenue teams identify opportunities, understand customer challenges, and engage prospects with precision. The Opportunity The Revenue Intelligence Strategist sits at the intersection of AI, business intelligence, and revenue strategy. This role is responsible for identifying buying signals, uncovering high-priority accounts, and translating market intelligence into actionable revenue plays that drive pipeline, accelerate sales … View more and apply Pages: Page 1 Page 2 Page 3 … Page 50 Contact & Location Phone 508-531-1328 Email careerservices@bridgew.edu Website https://careers.bridgew.edu/ Address Rondileau Student Union (RSU), Room 104 19 Park Avenue Bridgewater, MA 02325 Office Hours M Monday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm T Tuesday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm W Wednesday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm TH Thursday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm F Friday 9:00 am - 5:00 pm Phone 508-531-1328 Email careerservices@bridgew.edu Website https://careers.bridgew.edu/ Address Rondileau Student Union (RSU), Room 104 19 Park Avenue Bridgewater, MA 02325 Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Alumni Connections Blog Events Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Bridgewater State University"
